      "created_at": "2024-12-03T09:09:09.526Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have an expected COGS as a “Periodic Inventory”, calculated as following: (Open Stock Value - Closing Stock Value) + Purchases</p>\n<p>In my case we are using “Perpetual Inventory”, so by the end of the month I should expect that the Periodic Inventory will match the Perpetual Inventory.</p>\n<p>My question: Is there is a way to verify the COGS in “Perpetual Inventory”? How to trigger recalculating the COGS?</p>",
