      "id": 477089,
      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2025-08-11T15:12:44.379Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/naik_shreyas\">@Naik_Shreyas</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/a7medabdien\">@A7medAbdien</a></p>\n<p>The Both valuation systems 1. Perpetual and 2. Periodic are supported within ERPNext.</p>\n<p>The Periodic Valuation system does not impact general ledger for any of the stock transactions such as purchase receipt, delivery note, stock entry and reconciliations at all <strong>But</strong> Stock Ledger is there for valuation purposes. You have to book COGS manually into GL by having stock reports.</p>\n<p>Talking about COGS, by the time you want a JV to be passed for P&amp;L reporting generally by the end of each month, stock balance report <strong>Out Qty</strong> column will be reflecting items either sold, scrapped or consumed with respective costs.  Please keep in mind  stock ledger is recording each stock transactions for <strong>Valuation Purposes</strong> but that impact is not going into GL due to periodic setting ON.</p>\n<p>The following is the stock balance report with highlighted columns capturing costs.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/2/927edbd5aa7ba716f9c4d99e21138a6535bb5921.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/927edbd5aa7ba716f9c4d99e21138a6535bb5921\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/2/927edbd5aa7ba716f9c4d99e21138a6535bb5921_2_690x327.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kTXvgn2G2DKW48i7fVo2vasag81\" width=\"690\" height=\"327\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/2/927edbd5aa7ba716f9c4d99e21138a6535bb5921_2_690x327.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/2/927edbd5aa7ba716f9c4d99e21138a6535bb5921_2_1035x490.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/2/927edbd5aa7ba716f9c4d99e21138a6535bb5921_2_1380x654.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F6F0\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1907×905 82.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I made a sales invoice selling item as following hitting stock ledger but not GL due Periodic settings on within company.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/0/70d1386c8f414b1d8c33ea52267b52a5a6a07cb9.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/70d1386c8f414b1d8c33ea52267b52a5a6a07cb9\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/0/70d1386c8f414b1d8c33ea52267b52a5a6a07cb9_2_690x378.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"g61JdB49QXv9EViPQnZ4iRVeLZT\" width=\"690\" height=\"378\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/0/70d1386c8f414b1d8c33ea52267b52a5a6a07cb9_2_690x378.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/0/70d1386c8f414b1d8c33ea52267b52a5a6a07cb9_2_1035x567.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/0/70d1386c8f414b1d8c33ea52267b52a5a6a07cb9_2_1380x756.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBF9F1\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1632×896 77 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The accounting of sales invoice did not hit COGS.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/a/aa8e0c311357bf75f8f10da3f1b54c9a07f5765a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/aa8e0c311357bf75f8f10da3f1b54c9a07f5765a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/a/aa8e0c311357bf75f8f10da3f1b54c9a07f5765a_2_690x357.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"okNvlyghkbpIijtxeOI2inOZGbM\" width=\"690\" height=\"357\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/a/aa8e0c311357bf75f8f10da3f1b54c9a07f5765a_2_690x357.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/a/aa8e0c311357bf75f8f10da3f1b54c9a07f5765a_2_1035x535.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/a/aa8e0c311357bf75f8f10da3f1b54c9a07f5765a_2_1380x714.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F6F4\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1673×868 90.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>My profit and loss still waiting for COGS posted through a JV manually…</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/5/c584b520b3ccd37b1c7e3f68c5dc0ce3f8fd4ef1.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/c584b520b3ccd37b1c7e3f68c5dc0ce3f8fd4ef1\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/5/c584b520b3ccd37b1c7e3f68c5dc0ce3f8fd4ef1_2_690x398.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"sbknWKmysLDFiHGapeiEvh0rnnX\" width=\"690\" height=\"398\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/5/c584b520b3ccd37b1c7e3f68c5dc0ce3f8fd4ef1_2_690x398.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/5/c584b520b3ccd37b1c7e3f68c5dc0ce3f8fd4ef1_2_1035x597.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/5/c584b520b3ccd37b1c7e3f68c5dc0ce3f8fd4ef1_2_1380x796.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FDFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1549×894 39.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The Gross Profit Report helps you find each item or invoice COGS as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/a/7a62a7807a04e0970d8547641de85ee3faf47c0e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/7a62a7807a04e0970d8547641de85ee3faf47c0e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/a/7a62a7807a04e0970d8547641de85ee3faf47c0e_2_690x284.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hsFCgLURHTlSHUFFAMBow7DNZxk\" width=\"690\" height=\"284\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/a/7a62a7807a04e0970d8547641de85ee3faf47c0e_2_690x284.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/a/7a62a7807a04e0970d8547641de85ee3faf47c0e_2_1035x426.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/a/7a62a7807a04e0970d8547641de85ee3faf47c0e_2_1380x568.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F5F5\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1656×683 61.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
