      "id": 477109,
      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2025-08-11T23:15:27.644Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/naik_shreyas\">@Naik_Shreyas</a></p>\n<p>Please use Stock Balance Report and use data from it to pass your JV to match your GLs with your Stock Reports as this is what Periodic Valuation System requires you to do by end of each month.</p>\n<p>The Stock Balance Report has all you want as opening balance + In Qty and Value Columns (purchase receipt) - Out Qty (COGS) = Closing Balance (Stock in Hand).<br>\nItem group is also located of top of the report to server filtering purposes.</p>\n<p>You only need to generate report on a date where you want to match it with your GLs and for that pass a compound JV as following;</p>\n<p>Dr Inventory (Closing)          XXX<br>\nDr COGS                               XXX<br>\nCr Inventory (Opening)                XXX<br>\nCr Purchases                                XXX</p>",
